window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She’s a witch marked for death—haunted by the past, hunted in the present, and trusting a vampire who might be her last hope… or her final mistake.</p> <p>Pepper Boucher just wants to live a quiet life—but fate has other plans. Plagued by violent visions of witch burnings and blood-soaked dreams she can’t explain, she’s barely holding it together. Then comes Leon: a dark, mysterious vampire with secrets of his own… and a warning that could shatter everything.</p> <p>Witches in Graves Parish are being murdered, and Pepper is next on the list. Someone—or something—is determined to wipe her out, and they’ll burn the entire bayou down to do it.</p> <p>With a rogue vampire at her side and the ghost of a long-dead witch whispering secrets from beyond the veil, Pepper must unravel a deadly prophecy before time runs out. Because in Bayou Belle, the past doesn’t stay buried—and neither do the witches.</p>"; 
